"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e996a83d46f881b53956","start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o054b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-03ef9029e4f75daea2ea","layer":"original","quote":"而逊外生顾谭、顾承、姚信〖23〗，并以亲附太子，枉见流徙〖24〗。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o054","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-03ef9029e4f75daea2ea","layer":"original","quote":"书三四上，及求诣都，欲口论嫡庶之分，以匡得失。既不听许，而逊外生顾谭、顾承、姚信〖23〗，并以亲附太子，枉见流徙〖24〗。太子太傅吾粲，坐数与逊交书，下狱死。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-4e85b27a24e2bbb0087d","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-de5d6c412a1c6dd60cc2","layer":"original","quote":"权称尊号〖10〗","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-35be8287455e56599f63","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-91e8cecd70f6f0423363","layer":"original","quote":"黄龙元年，权称尊号，立为皇太子。以恪为左辅〖14〗，休右弼；谭为辅正，表为翼正都尉：是为“四友”。而谢景、范慎、刁玄、羊衜等，皆为宾客。﹝一﹞于是东宫号为多士","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-60e5b248903bb26daf08","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-f77eaac96e37b2d3db4c","layer":"original","quote":"陆逊、吾粲、顾谭等数陈嫡庶之义，理不可夺；全寄、杨竺为鲁王霸支党，谮诉日兴〖6〗。粲遂下狱诛，谭徙交州","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-e6d45d4a1d69982d86a6","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-596a36f6bf0b6112c3af","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，立登为太子。选置师傅；铨简秀士，以为宾友。于是诸葛恪、张休、顾谭、陈表等以选入〖4〗，侍讲诗书，出从骑射","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-f5c695232dc8ff7315a1","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-f77eaac96e37b2d3db4c","layer":"original","quote":"陆逊、吾粲、顾谭等数陈嫡庶之义，理不可夺；全寄、杨竺为鲁王霸支党，谮诉日兴〖6〗。粲遂下狱诛，谭徙交州","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-948ebe88c7631151d983","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-cc31a8020d94eea20679","layer":"original","quote":"弱冠拜骑都尉〖2〗，与顾谭、张休等，侍太子登讲论道艺〖3〗，并为宾友。从中庶子转为左辅都尉。","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o116a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-695017bf1b0f92689783","layer":"original","quote":"顾谭议〖19〗，以为：“奔丧立科〖20〗，轻则不足以禁孝子之情，重则本非应死之罪。虽严刑益设〖21〗，违夺必少〖22〗；若偶有犯者，加其刑则恩所不忍，有减则法废不行。愚以为长吏在远，苟不告语〖23〗，势不得知。比选代之间〖24〗，若有传者〖25〗，必加大辟〖26〗。则长吏无废职之负〖27〗，孝子无犯重之刑〖28〗。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o116","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-695017bf1b0f92689783","layer":"original","quote":"顾谭议〖19〗，以为：“奔丧立科〖20〗，轻则不足以禁孝子之情，重则本非应死之罪。虽严刑益设〖21〗，违夺必少〖22〗；若偶有犯者，加其刑则恩所不忍，有减则法废不行。愚以为长吏在远，苟不告语〖23〗，势不得知。比选代之间〖24〗，若有传者〖25〗，必加大辟〖26〗。则长吏无废职之负〖27〗，孝子无犯重之刑〖28〗。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":78,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-14652d6c7f6da05656eb","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-07c8f45fbc8ad2c4659c","layer":"pei","quote":"谭初践官府，上疏陈事；权辍食称善，以为过于徐详","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":233,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-24e22a3d02e1b41639fb","start":10,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-1c9ca3b61d317128def7","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-c2db92ae9783f7e671c4","layer":"original","quote":"赤乌中，代恪为左节度〖2〗。﹝二﹞每省簿书〖3〗，未尝下筹〖4〗；徒屈指心计〖5〗，尽发疑谬：下吏以此服之","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-202a19429eac1e534015","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-5dc0554e7980c6318f0b","layer":"original","quote":"谭字子默。弱冠与诸葛恪等，为太子四友；从中庶子转辅正都尉〖1〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-2118af879a75b871779c","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-c2db92ae9783f7e671c4","layer":"original","quote":"加奉车都尉〖6〗。","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-26679fae161125802c23","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-c2db92ae9783f7e671c4","layer":"original","quote":"加奉车都尉〖6〗。薛综为选曹尚书〖7〗，固让谭曰：“谭心精体密，贯道达微；才照人物，德允众望：诚非愚臣所可越先。”后遂代综。祖父雍卒数月，拜太常，代雍平尚书事","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-3daa3c56b9872fdc7a53","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-60fc7c60c8160373a740","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：张昭受遗辅佐，功勋克举；忠謇方直，动不为己。而以严见惮〖1〗，以高见外；既不处宰相，又不登师保〖2〗；从容闾巷〖3〗，养老而已：以此明权之不及策也！顾雍依仗素业〖4〗，而将之智局〖5〗：故能究极荣位。诸葛瑾、步骘，并以德度规检，见器当世〖6〗；张承、顾邵，虚心长者，好尚人物；周昭之论，称之甚美：故详录焉。谭献纳在公，有忠贞之节；休、承修志，咸庶为善；爱恶相攻〖7〗，流播南裔〖8〗：哀哉！","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":519,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":198,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-55d57ae922cf7f838007","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-c195e655860b7fd17bee","layer":"original","quote":"在郡五年，卒官","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":7,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-5753a1dfe780c42876e8","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-b40c947750c1f3ef6493","layer":"original","quote":"是时，鲁王霸有盛宠，与太子和齐衡。谭上疏曰：“臣闻有国有家者，必明嫡庶之端，异尊卑之礼；使高下有差，阶级逾邈〖8〗。如此则骨肉之恩生，觊觎之望绝。昔贾谊陈治安之计〖9〗，论诸侯之势，以为：势重，虽亲必有逆节之累〖10〗；势轻，虽疏必有保全之祚〖11〗。故淮南亲弟〖12〗，不终飨国〖13〗，失之于势重也；吴芮疏臣〖14〗，传祚长沙，得之于势轻也。昔汉文帝使慎夫人与皇后同席〖15〗，袁盎退夫人之座〖16〗，帝有怒色。及盎辨上下之仪，陈人彘之戒〖17〗；帝既悦怿，夫人亦悟。今臣所陈，非有所偏〖18〗；诚欲以安太子，而便鲁王也。”由是霸与谭有隙。","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":196,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":272,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-5f7279a85811f4d22444","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-5dc0554e7980c6318f0b","layer":"original","quote":"谭字子默。弱冠与诸葛恪等，为太子四友；从中庶子转辅正都尉","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-6163095ab74ad9fe3f3f","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-2bdfa139d02fde705f5b","layer":"pei","quote":"权嫁从女，女顾氏甥，故请雍父子及孙谭。谭时为选曹尚书，见任贵重。是日，权极欢。谭醉酒，三起舞，舞不知止：雍内怒之。明日，召谭，诃责之曰：‘君王以含垢为德，臣下以恭谨为节。昔萧何、吴汉，并有大功：何每见高帝，似不能言；汉奉光武，亦信恪勤。汝之于国，宁有汗马之劳，可书之事邪？但阶门户之资，遂见宠任耳！何有舞不复知止？虽为酒后，亦由恃恩忘敬，谦虚不足。损吾家者，必尔也！’因背，向壁卧；谭立，过一时，乃见遣","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c5f62508b513eb563318","start":11,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-646fa23ad577891559ac","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-a37fb1b650b51a66ec20","layer":"original","quote":"谭坐徙交州。幽而发愤，著《新言》二十篇。其《知难篇》，盖以自悼伤也。见流二年〖25〗，年四十二，卒于交阯","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-c717b14f5045b93be823","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-125f1c811c0beb60a9de","layer":"original","quote":"休字叔嗣。弱冠与诸葛恪、顾谭等俱为太子登僚友〖14〗，以《汉书》授登；﹝三﹞从中庶子转为右弼都尉","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":95,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d0dbbb7f5888a03c83db","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-6eb0af4c477f92dd3257","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《吴录》曰：“全琮父子屡言：‘芍陂之役，为典军陈恂诈增张休、顾承之功，而休、承与恂通情。’休坐系狱；权为谭故，沉吟不决，欲令谭谢而释之。及大会，以问谭；谭不谢，而曰：‘陛下，谗言其兴乎？’”","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":234,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0e9e6cb7871c9e632d55","start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d3abff7f0ed0878c62c7","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-955bc76fedbdb17b7b8b","layer":"pei","quote":"有司奏谭‘诬罔大不敬，罪应大辟’。权以雍故，不致法，皆徙之","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":235,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0e9e6cb7871c9e632d55","start":8,"end":37,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d7c6bfee867816b7caf2","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-e7c668f34b2cb03e8c27","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞陆机为谭传曰：“宣太子正位东宫，天子方隆训导之义；妙简俊彦，讲学左右。时四方之杰毕集，太傅诸葛恪等，雄奇盖众；而谭以清识绝伦，独见推重。自太尉范慎、谢景、（羊徽）〔羊衟〕之徒，皆以秀称；其名而悉在谭下。”","attribution":"裴注·陆机《顾谭传》","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6e97af01b0f6928da4e6","start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d8d548abae9ff752f208","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-27c78b18246ae3b6bd51","layer":"original","quote":"数年，与兄谭、张休等，俱徙交州。年三十七卒","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d95ac6b70220ae016119","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-0ccf265f45e5a3e57842","layer":"original","quote":"为鲁王霸友党所谮，与顾谭、承俱以“芍陂论功事〖19〗，休、承与典军陈恂通情，诈增其伐〖20〗”，并徙交州","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":96,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-fc9f571d0cb76f69f3a1","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-027aa53bd5dbba95ebf6","layer":"original","quote":"寄父子益恨，共构会谭","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":181,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"wuzhu-p0090":{"fields":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0090-directory-courtesy","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"子默","evidence":["zhanggu-q-5f7279a85811f4d22444"]}],"directory":{"faction":"wu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
